{
  "kind": "landflow/template",
  "version": 1,
  "template": {
    "name": "IOC lookup API",
    "description": "A small read-only endpoint for analysts and other tools: POST an IP, domain, URL or hash and get one verdict across VirusTotal, AbuseIPDB, GreyNoise and urlscan.io.",
    "categories": [
      "security"
    ],
    "credentials": [
      {
        "id": "alertWebhook",
        "type": "core.httpHeaderAuth",
        "name": "Webhook secret",
        "description": "A header name and secret your senders put on every request (for example Authorization: Bearer …)."
      },
      {
        "id": "virustotal",
        "type": "threat-intel.virusTotalApi",
        "name": "VirusTotal",
        "description": "A VirusTotal API key.",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "id": "abuseipdb",
        "type": "threat-intel.abuseIpDbApi",
        "name": "AbuseIPDB",
        "description": "An AbuseIPDB API key.",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "id": "greynoise",
        "type": "threat-intel.greyNoiseApi",
        "name": "GreyNoise",
        "description": "A GreyNoise key (the community API works without one).",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "id": "urlscan",
        "type": "threat-intel.urlscanApi",
        "name": "urlscan.io",
        "description": "A urlscan.io API key.",
        "optional": true
      }
    ],
    "setup": [
      "Add the threat intel keys you have to **Enrich**: each service runs only with its credential.",
      "POST `{ \"ioc\": \"1.2.3.4\" }` (or `{ \"iocs\": [\"evil.example\", \"…\"] }`) to the webhook with the **Webhook secret** header; the answer is the verdict, score, reasons and each service’s result.",
      "Lookups are cached for an hour; private and reserved addresses are never sent out."
    ],
    "dataTables": [],
    "workflow": {
      "name": "IOC lookup API",
      "description": "A small read-only endpoint for analysts and other tools: POST an IP, domain, URL or hash and get one verdict across VirusTotal, AbuseIPDB, GreyNoise and urlscan.io.",
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "hook",
          "name": "Look up an IOC",
          "type": "core.webhook",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            0,
            0
          ],
          "parameters": {
            "path": "ioc-lookup",
            "method": "POST",
            "authentication": "headerAuth",
            "respond": "responseNode"
          },
          "credentials": {
            "httpHeaderAuth": {
              "id": "alertWebhook",
              "name": "Webhook secret"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "enrich",
          "name": "Enrich",
          "type": "threat-intel.iocEnrich",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            280,
            0
          ],
          "parameters": {
            "iocPath": "body.ioc",
            "iocsPath": "body.iocs",
            "cacheTtl": 3600,
            "options": {
              "keepInput": false,
              "outputField": "result"
            }
          },
          "credentials": {
            "virusTotalApi": {
              "id": "virustotal",
              "name": "VirusTotal"
            },
            "abuseIpDbApi": {
              "id": "abuseipdb",
              "name": "AbuseIPDB"
            },
            "greyNoiseApi": {
              "id": "greynoise",
              "name": "GreyNoise"
            },
            "urlscanApi": {
              "id": "urlscan",
              "name": "urlscan.io"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "reply",
          "name": "Respond",
          "type": "core.respondToWebhook",
          "typeVersion": 1,
          "position": [
            560,
            0
          ],
          "parameters": {
            "respondWith": "json",
            "responseBody": "{{ JSON.stringify($json.result) }}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "connections": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "main",
          "source": "hook",
          "sourceIndex": 0,
          "target": "enrich",
          "targetIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "main",
          "source": "enrich",
          "sourceIndex": 0,
          "target": "reply",
          "targetIndex": 0
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
